  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.160" end="00:08.760" ttm:agent="v1">You board at eleven</p>
      <p begin="00:08.760" end="00:11.110" ttm:agent="v1">It's nine thirty seven</p>
      <p begin="00:11.110" end="00:13.670" ttm:agent="v1">I'm waiting waiting</p>
      <p begin="00:13.670" end="00:15.170" ttm:agent="v1">In only a short time</p>
      <p begin="00:15.120" end="00:16.890" ttm:agent="v1">Forget what you feel like</p>
      <p begin="00:16.890" end="00:19.930" ttm:agent="v1">You got it at all</p>
      <p begin="00:19.930" end="00:21.520" ttm:agent="v1">I'm wearing your leather</p>
      <p begin="00:21.520" end="00:24.070" ttm:agent="v1">Your clothes fit me better</p>
      <p begin="00:24.070" end="00:26.190" ttm:agent="v1">I feel you feel you</p>
      <p begin="00:26.190" end="00:27.900" ttm:agent="v1">Let me take in this moment</p>
      <p begin="00:27.900" end="00:31.310" ttm:agent="v1">I just want to hold it before you're gone</p>
      <p begin="00:31.310" end="00:34.720" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm halfway out the door</p>
      <p begin="00:34.720" end="00:37.720" ttm:agent="v1">I steal one more look</p>
      <p begin="00:37.720" end="00:41.700" ttm:agent="v1">Feel I'm breaking more and more</p>
      <p begin="00:41.700" end="00:47.390" ttm:agent="v1">Every time you go away</p>
      <p begin="00:47.390" end="00:50.060" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna miss you</p>
      <p begin="00:50.060" end="00:53.760" ttm:agent="v1">If it's the last thing that I do</p>
      <p begin="00:53.760" end="00:56.540" ttm:agent="v1">Get in the car now</p>
      <p begin="00:56.540" end="01:00.110" ttm:agent="v1">Let it take you away</p>
      <p begin="01:00.110" end="01:02.870" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna miss you</p>
      <p begin="01:02.870" end="01:06.410" ttm:agent="v1">If it's the last thing that I do</p>
      <p begin="01:06.410" end="01:09.520" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me you wanna</p>
      <p begin="01:09.520" end="01:14.340" ttm:agent="v1">Just stay here with me</p>
      <p begin="01:14.340" end="01:16.040" ttm:agent="v1">We ran down the canyon</p>
      <p begin="01:16.040" end="01:18.510" ttm:agent="v1">And dreamed of a mansion</p>
      <p begin="01:18.510" end="01:20.750" ttm:agent="v1">One day one day</p>
      <p begin="01:20.750" end="01:22.380" ttm:agent="v1">No cash to inherit</p>
      <p begin="01:22.380" end="01:24.030" ttm:agent="v1">We'll save up and share it</p>
      <p begin="01:24.030" end="01:25.760" ttm:agent="v1">We laughed it off</p>
      <p begin="01:25.760" end="01:29.150" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm halfway out the door</p>
      <p begin="01:29.150" end="01:32.190" ttm:agent="v1">I steal one more look</p>
      <p begin="01:32.190" end="01:36.220" ttm:agent="v1">Feel I'm breaking more and more</p>
      <p begin="01:36.220" end="01:41.760" ttm:agent="v1">Every time you go away</p>
      <p begin="01:41.760" end="01:44.470" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna miss you</p>
      <p begin="01:44.470" end="01:48.150" ttm:agent="v1">If it's the last thing that I do</p>
      <p begin="01:48.150" end="01:50.960" ttm:agent="v1">Get in the car now</p>
      <p begin="01:50.960" end="01:54.500" ttm:agent="v1">Let it take you away</p>
      <p begin="01:54.500" end="01:57.270" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna miss you</p>
      <p begin="01:57.270" end="02:00.830" ttm:agent="v1">If it's the last thing that I do</p>
      <p begin="02:00.830" end="02:03.900" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me you wanna</p>
      <p begin="02:03.900" end="02:10.100" ttm:agent="v1">Just stay here with me</p>
      <p begin="02:10.100" end="02:14.870" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:14.870" end="02:21.360" ttm:agent="v1">Ten thousand miles of open road</p>
      <p begin="02:21.360" end="02:27.720" ttm:agent="v1">Ten thousand miles of blue</p>
      <p begin="02:27.720" end="02:34.110" ttm:agent="v1">Ten thousand words and marigolds</p>
      <p begin="02:34.110" end="02:39.350" ttm:agent="v1">I'll find my way to you</p>
      <p begin="02:39.350" end="02:42.010" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna miss you</p>
      <p begin="02:42.010" end="02:45.770" ttm:agent="v1">If it's the last thing that I do</p>
      <p begin="02:45.770" end="02:48.510" ttm:agent="v1">Get in the car now</p>
      <p begin="02:48.510" end="02:52.160" ttm:agent="v1">Let it take you away</p>
      <p begin="02:52.160" end="02:54.880" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna miss you</p>
      <p begin="02:54.880" end="02:58.490" ttm:agent="v1">If it's the last thing that I do</p>
      <p begin="02:58.490" end="03:01.570" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me you wanna</p>
      <p begin="03:01.570" end="03:04.800" ttm:agent="v1">Just stay here with me</p>
      <p begin="03:04.800" end="03:07.930" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me you wanna</p>
      <p begin="03:07.930" end="03:11.310" ttm:agent="v1">Just stay here with me</p>
      <p begin="03:11.310" end="03:14.310" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me you wanna</p>
      <p begin="03:14.310" end="03:15.810" ttm:agent="v1">Just stay here with me</p>
